sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KServe as KServe Controller
    participant StorageInit as KServe Storage Initializer
    participant OVMS as OVMS Pod<br/>/ovms/bin/ovms
    participant ModelStore as Model Storage<br/>(S3 / PVC)
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over KServe, OVMS: Deployment Phase
    KServe->>OVMS: Create Pod via ServingRuntime CR
    StorageInit->>ModelStore: Fetch model artifacts
    ModelStore-->>StorageInit: Model files
    StorageInit->>OVMS: Mount to /mnt/models
    OVMS->>OVMS: Load models from /mnt/models
    OVMS-->>KServe: /v2/health/ready → 200 OK

    Note over Client, OVMS: REST Inference (TFS V1)
    Client->>OVMS: POST /v1/models/{name}:predict<br/>Port 8888/TCP (RHOAI)
    OVMS->>OVMS: HttpRestApiHandler dispatches<br/>to TFS V1 predict handler
    OVMS-->>Client: JSON prediction response

    Note over Client, OVMS: REST Inference (KServe V2)
    Client->>OVMS: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>Port 8888/TCP (RHOAI)
    OVMS->>OVMS: HttpRestApiHandler dispatches<br/>to KServe V2 infer handler
    OVMS-->>Client: JSON inference response

    Note over Client, OVMS: REST Inference (OpenAI V3)
    Client->>OVMS: POST /v3/chat/completions<br/>Port 8888/TCP (RHOAI)
    OVMS->>OVMS: HttpRestApiHandler dispatches<br/>to OpenAI V3 handler
    OVMS-->>Client: JSON/SSE response

    Note over Client, OVMS: gRPC Inference
    Client->>OVMS: ModelInfer / ModelStreamInfer RPC<br/>Port 8001/TCP (RHOAI)
    OVMS->>OVMS: GRPCInferenceService processes
    OVMS-->>Client: gRPC response (unary or stream)

    Note over Client, OVMS: Optional mTLS Path
    Client->>Client: Present client certificate
    Client->>OVMS: TLS 1.2 + mTLS via nginx sidecar
    Note right of OVMS: nginx terminates TLS,<br/>proxies to OVMS<br/>on loopback ports

    Note over Prom, OVMS: Metrics Collection
    Prom->>OVMS: GET /metrics<br/>Port 8888/TCP
    OVMS-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
